1
00:00:38,000 --> 00:00:40,000
[EP08]

2
00:00:42,800 --> 00:00:44,740
But she chose me, didn't she?

3
00:00:45,240 --> 00:00:45,720
Su Hong,

4
00:00:46,180 --> 00:00:47,400
I sent you here

5
00:00:47,780 --> 00:00:48,700
because you're her brother.

6
00:00:49,080 --> 00:00:50,040
Don't push your luck.

7
00:00:50,480 --> 00:00:51,320
My brother is on my side.

8
00:00:51,480 --> 00:00:52,060
It's only right.

9
00:00:55,580 --> 00:00:56,320
Get some rest.

10
00:00:56,820 --> 00:00:57,760
Don't worry about anything else.

11
00:00:58,380 --> 00:00:59,500
I'll always be on your side.

12
00:01:03,040 --> 00:01:03,440
Brother.

13
00:01:05,380 --> 00:01:06,280
Let go of me.

14
00:01:06,700 --> 00:01:07,460
Let go of me.

15
00:01:10,360 --> 00:01:11,020
Let go of me.

16
00:01:11,840 --> 00:01:12,660
Let go of me.

17
00:01:21,240 --> 00:01:21,980
Chu Nanfeng.

18
00:01:23,260 --> 00:01:24,200
What did I touch yesterday?

19
00:01:26,920 --> 00:01:27,360
Tell me.

20
00:01:29,360 --> 00:01:30,000
What exactly did I touch?

21
00:01:39,140 --> 00:01:40,160
You want to kill me.

22
00:01:41,220 --> 00:01:42,520
You said that

23
00:01:43,220 --> 00:01:44,340
