24
00:01:46,560 --> 00:01:47,760
I should put it here.

25
00:01:48,980 --> 00:01:49,760
You think I won't dare?

26
00:01:50,860 --> 00:01:51,880
You owe me a life.

27
00:01:51,980 --> 00:01:52,420
Oh.

28
00:01:53,480 --> 00:01:54,740
Your mother committed suicide.

29
00:01:54,780 --> 00:01:55,920
What does it have to do with me?

30
00:01:57,460 --> 00:01:58,160
Let's divorce.

31
00:02:01,480 --> 00:02:02,120
Divorce?

32
00:02:03,300 --> 00:02:04,360
Are you going to find Chu Nanfeng?

33
00:02:04,660 --> 00:02:05,600
You don't kill Boren,

34
00:02:06,480 --> 00:02:07,660
but he dies because of you.

35
00:02:08,320 --> 00:02:09,900
I can't stay with you anymore.

36
00:02:10,600 --> 00:02:11,200
Is this reason

37
00:02:12,020 --> 00:02:12,500
enough?

38
00:02:15,260 --> 00:02:15,680
Fine.

39
00:02:16,480 --> 00:02:17,780
I'll kill Hongxiu right now.

40
00:02:18,460 --> 00:02:18,720
And

41
00:02:20,380 --> 00:02:20,820
this

42
00:02:21,380 --> 00:02:22,720
is the letter your mother left.

43
00:02:23,140 --> 00:02:24,220
I'll just tear it up.

44
00:02:27,440 --> 00:02:27,820
Give it to me.

45
00:02:28,340 --> 00:02:28,920
Give it to me.

46
00:02:29,600 --> 00:02:29,960
Give it to me.

47
00:02:30,360 --> 00:02:30,680
Give it to me.

48
00:02:31,600 --> 00:02:32,560
Let's play a game.

49
00:02:34,040 --> 00:02:35,220
I'll give you three days

50
00:02:39,680 --> 00:02:40,720
to find this gun

51
00:02:41,220 --> 00:02:42,100
and get it.

52
00:02:42,440 --> 00:02:43,080
Otherwise,

53
00:02:44,340 --> 00:02:45,400
I'll burn the letter.

54
00:02:46,960 --> 00:02:47,360
Bah!

55
00:02:47,780 --> 00:02:49,520
Who would play such a boring game with you?

56
00:02:52,100 --> 00:02:52,460
My dear,

57
00:02:53,240 --> 00:02:55,480
everything in this world comes with conditions.

58
00:02:55,700 --> 00:02:56,320
If you want something,

59
00:02:57,500 --> 00:02:58,360
you have to fight for it.

60
00:03:06,960 --> 00:03:07,260
Will you play?

61
00:03:08,440 --> 00:03:08,820
Yes.

62
00:03:18,040 --> 00:03:19,860
[Where could Ling Shenxing have hidden the gun?]

63
00:03:30,420 --> 00:03:31,760
Nothing here.

64
00:03:43,340 --> 00:03:44,740
What are you doing in my study so early?

65
00:03:45,460 --> 00:03:46,120
[Oh, no.]

66
00:03:46,400 --> 00:03:47,340
[He found me.]

67
00:03:49,800 --> 00:03:50,380
Young Marshal.

68
00:03:50,480 --> 00:03:51,260
You're up so early.

69
00:03:52,160 --> 00:03:53,020
Well,

70
00:03:53,240 --> 00:03:54,240
I'm looking for a book

71
00:03:54,360 --> 00:03:55,320
to pass the time.

72
00:03:55,620 --> 00:03:56,480
I don't have

73
00:03:56,800 --> 00:03:58,060
anything to entertain you.

74
00:03:58,640 --> 00:03:59,340
Behave yourself.

75
00:04:13,820 --> 00:04:15,800
[I searched the Ling family but found no gun.]

76
00:04:16,220 --> 00:04:18,160
[It must be with Ling Shenxing.]

77
00:04:20,060 --> 00:04:20,980
[Ling Shenxing,]

78
00:04:21,500 --> 00:04:23,200
[I don't believe so much knockout drops]

79
00:04:23,200 --> 00:04:24,080
[can't make you dizzy.]

80
00:04:26,180 --> 00:04:26,700
Young Marshal,

81
00:04:27,340 --> 00:04:28,220
you haven't rested yet.

82
00:04:28,880 --> 00:04:30,440
I've prepared a tranquilizing tea for you.

83
00:04:31,620 --> 00:04:32,200
Put it down.

84
00:04:32,560 --> 00:04:33,640
[Ling Shenxing]

85
00:04:33,700 --> 00:04:34,660
[is still pretending to be aloof.]

86
00:04:34,760 --> 00:04:35,440
That's not gonna work.

87
00:04:36,520 --> 00:04:36,900
Forget it.

88
00:04:37,300 --> 00:04:37,920
I'll go all out.

89
00:04:39,720 --> 00:04:40,520
Young Marshal,

90
00:04:44,380 --> 00:04:45,600
this tea

91
00:04:45,780 --> 00:04:47,180
is specially made for you.

92
00:04:48,020 --> 00:04:49,160
You've been working so hard.

93
00:04:50,080 --> 00:04:51,080
This tea

94
00:04:51,760 --> 00:04:52,840
is good for your health.

95
00:04:56,120 --> 00:04:57,000
I'm in good health.

96
00:04:57,560 --> 00:04:58,420
I don't need it.

97
00:05:00,920 --> 00:05:02,240
What are you up to?

98
00:05:02,940 --> 00:05:03,520
Cousin.

99
00:05:04,160 --> 00:05:05,460
I saw your study light is still on.

100
00:05:08,160 --> 00:05:09,200
Miss Su is here too.

101
00:05:09,480 --> 00:05:10,580
[What is she doing here?]

102
00:05:10,760 --> 00:05:11,800
[Such a bad timing.]

103
00:05:12,840 --> 00:05:13,900
[My plan is going to be ruined.]

104
00:05:13,940 --> 00:05:14,880
When you were studying abroad,

105
00:05:14,880 --> 00:05:16,260
you got used to drinking

106
00:05:16,420 --> 00:05:17,940
to help you sleep.

107
00:05:18,180 --> 00:05:19,000
I'm afraid

108
00:05:19,080 --> 00:05:20,080
he's not used to tea.

109
00:05:20,840 --> 00:05:21,720
Miss Su,

110
00:05:21,980 --> 00:05:22,980
you seem to know little about him.

111
00:05:24,360 --> 00:05:24,920
Cousin,

112
00:05:25,200 --> 00:05:26,640
I brought this liquor from abroad.

113
00:05:26,960 --> 00:05:28,000
I guess you must like it.

114
00:05:30,960 --> 00:05:31,840
[She's trying to steal him.]

115
00:05:32,660 --> 00:05:33,960
[If you take the tea away,]

116
00:05:34,160 --> 00:05:35,260
[my plan will be ruined.]

117
00:05:35,680 --> 00:05:36,900
Don't bother, Miss Ye.

118
00:05:38,120 --> 00:05:39,100
This tea

119
00:05:39,180 --> 00:05:40,520
is specially prepared for Young Marshal.

120
00:05:40,520 --> 00:05:42,060
He won't like this tea.

121
00:05:56,660 --> 00:05:57,200
Cousin

122
00:05:57,360 --> 00:05:58,400
I'm sorry.

123
00:05:58,560 --> 00:05:59,600
I just think

124
00:05:59,720 --> 00:06:00,780
Miss Su may not know your habits.

125
00:06:00,780 --> 00:06:01,860
Miss Su may not know your habits.

126
00:06:02,160 --> 00:06:03,180
I didn't mean it.

127
00:06:03,420 --> 00:06:04,160
Miss Su

128
00:06:04,340 --> 00:06:04,980
I'm sorry.

129
00:06:05,020 --> 00:06:05,960
Stop it.

130
00:06:06,500 --> 00:06:06,980
I'm sleepy.

131
00:06:07,320 --> 00:06:07,940
I wanna sleep.

132
00:06:08,560 --> 00:06:09,240
The tea

133
00:06:09,340 --> 00:06:10,680
is better to drink when it's hot.

134
00:06:11,320 --> 00:06:11,880
Young Marshal,

135
00:06:12,360 --> 00:06:13,420
have a good rest.

136
00:06:13,660 --> 00:06:14,380
I'll leave you to it.

137
00:06:15,100 --> 00:06:15,860
Ye Jinrou,

138
00:06:16,040 --> 00:06:18,240
you made a strong cup of green tea.

139
00:06:18,560 --> 00:06:18,960
Wait and see.

140
00:06:19,720 --> 00:06:20,680
I must get back

141
00:06:20,920 --> 00:06:21,820
my mother's will.

142
00:06:27,320 --> 00:06:28,060
Good night.

143
00:06:49,980 --> 00:06:50,360
Good.

144
00:06:53,600 --> 00:06:54,500
You're back, Miss.

145
00:06:55,480 --> 00:06:55,820
What?

146
00:06:56,960 --> 00:06:57,640
My mother wrote to me?

147
00:06:58,200 --> 00:07:00,000
This is the letter from the Madam.

148
00:07:00,360 --> 00:07:02,180
She also said that you should try to be

149
00:07:02,260 --> 00:07:03,760
the third wife of the Marshal.

150
00:07:07,060 --> 00:07:07,900
The third wife?

151
00:07:17,100 --> 00:07:17,940
Is she insane?

152
00:07:18,640 --> 00:07:19,980
A man over fifty,

153
00:07:20,220 --> 00:07:21,200
why doesn't she marry him?

154
00:07:23,560 --> 00:07:25,420
How could she be my mother?

155
00:07:30,960 --> 00:07:31,740
Get out!

156
00:07:48,460 --> 00:07:49,040
Young Marshal.

157
00:07:50,680 --> 00:07:51,160
Young Marshal.

158
00:07:52,620 --> 00:07:53,740
Ling Shenxing,

159
00:07:54,240 --> 00:07:55,540
you did drink the tranquilizer tea.

160
00:08:01,100 --> 00:08:01,900
Piece of cake.

161
00:08:02,180 --> 00:08:03,040
I can handle this.

162
00:08:03,940 --> 00:08:05,460
The drug works well.

163
00:08:06,220 --> 00:08:07,780
Ling Shenxing is sleeping like a log.

164
00:08:08,440 --> 00:08:09,140
Then

165
00:08:09,240 --> 00:08:10,760
I can get the gun.

166
00:08:14,680 --> 00:08:15,540
He's still not awake.

167
00:08:22,480 --> 00:08:24,000
He's annoying,

168
00:08:24,280 --> 00:08:25,900
but he's good-looking.

169
00:08:29,980 --> 00:08:30,860
What are you thinking about?

170
00:08:30,940 --> 00:08:31,620
Focus on the task at hand.

171
00:08:44,020 --> 00:08:45,680
The gun is not in the pocket of the clothes.

172
00:08:46,760 --> 00:08:48,180
Does he carry the gun

173
