174
00:08:54,820 --> 00:08:55,400
I knew it.

175
00:08:56,640 --> 00:08:57,380
Childish.

176
00:09:04,340 --> 00:09:05,480
When did you wake up?

177
00:09:07,240 --> 00:09:08,260
Young Marshal, keep your word.

178
00:09:08,800 --> 00:09:09,580
I got the gun.

179
00:09:10,280 --> 00:09:11,460
You should fulfill your promise.

180
00:09:12,380 --> 00:09:13,320
You want to kill me.

181
00:09:15,060 --> 00:09:16,020
Let me go.

182
00:09:16,340 --> 00:09:17,100
Give me the suicide note.

183
00:09:17,820 --> 00:09:18,740
What if I say no?

184
00:09:20,360 --> 00:09:21,660
You think I dare not kill you?

185
00:09:26,260 --> 00:09:27,620
I thought you would say,

186
00:09:27,900 --> 00:09:28,860
my life

187
00:09:29,200 --> 00:09:29,980
for your mother's,

188
00:09:30,660 --> 00:09:31,220
we're even.

189
00:09:33,520 --> 00:09:33,820
Come on.

190
00:09:34,000 --> 00:09:34,920
I'll teach you how to shoot.

191
00:09:35,420 --> 00:09:36,020
Put your hand

192
00:09:36,700 --> 00:09:37,640
on it.

193
00:09:38,020 --> 00:09:38,620
Pull the bolt.

194
00:09:43,160 --> 00:09:43,800
Then,

195
00:09:44,580 --> 00:09:45,500
keep your wrist steady.

196
00:09:45,980 --> 00:09:46,600
Aim at this.
